The capture waits for `window.__enginePlayground.ready`, pauses the loop and reads the HUD, so the
printed object/visible/FPS/backend values belong to the captured PNG. At 390×844 the scene clamps the
fit zoom to 0.1 (raw fit 0.040625), so only 84 of 694 objects are visible, the canvas keeps its 16:9
aspect and `docScrollWidth == innerWidth` (no horizontal overflow).

