Benchmark mode is unchanged: `?bench=50000&samples=600&warmup=120` still writes
`window.__engineBenchmark` (`status`, `count`, `warmup`, `samples`, `frameTimesMs`, `renderer`,
`canvas`) and logs the `PERF_RESULT` line; the test-kit import is dynamic, so the perf harness copy
(which does not carry `packages/test-kit/dist`) keeps working.

